{{!
    @template mod_playervideo/question_hint

    A short bold label followed by a question preview: used for the "selected question" note and
    for each row of the "pull from bank" search results in the timeline editor. label is plain
    text and is escaped; preview is question HTML already run through format_text() on the
    server (search_questions / question_service) or produced by mod_playervideo/question_preview,
    so it is rendered unescaped.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "label": "Selected - press Save below to add it to the timeline.",
        "preview": "<p>Which is a volcano?</p>"
    }
}}
<strong>{{label}}</strong> {{{preview}}}
